{"parentUuid":"50578238-4d7e-4720-8e25-ad6da1f971f6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14419027 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a371d173-c953-48e8-a4c2-8668945cbd95","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:57:26.993Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14419027 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-b2-staleness","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"a371d173-c953-48e8-a4c2-8668945cbd95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNMyhPgZj5xXKu1WVzV3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Caught the same trap in my own work that I'd just sent back to the agent — fair is fair.\n\nThe JSON-emission guard on #484 is `strings.Contains`-based, so adding `excluded_records` passed every test without asserting anything about it, and **dropping it again would also have passed**. The field only exists to tell an incomplete answer from a complete one, so leaving it unguarded at the layer an agent actually reads defeated the point of the fix. Now asserted there, and proved by retagging the field `json:\"-\"`: the emission guard goes red while the construction guard stays green, so the two layers are independently held.\n\nProgress on the other two, from the remote rather than their transcripts: **#489's agent has pushed** (`db2d4ff9`) though it hasn't reported yet; **#477's** hasn't pushed. #483's is working the gap I returned.\n\nOne operational note: my verification command exceeded its foreground timeout and was moved to the background — load is genuinely high with three agents' suites running. That's why I've been checking progress via `git ls-remote` instead of starting anything new. The integration suite stays queued until the agents are done and the three branches have settled; running it now would both contend and measure branches that are about to change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":305206,"output_tokens":393,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":393,"cache_read_input_tokens":305206,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b1c6a00b-cfb6-48e3-8fed-fb6e61a4c2f5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNMygveux9qtRp9o3dYF","requestRef":"a21cf0f2-4d99-4b06-8cac-2b8d21b119eb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"06991bad-8cf0-45b4-bb15-474f99ac0390","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:57:34.109Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-b2-staleness","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
