ark #483 as \"merge resolved and verified, commit pending\" rather than green, and do NOT quote 201fe6eb as its final head.\n\n#493 IS STALE and I could not refresh it. It holds the older #483 and the older #489, and its suite result predates both. Re-pushing needs Bash. Please note it on the page as a snapshot against main@20eb1207, not a current result.\n\nTWO THINGS WORTH CARRYING, both verified:\n1. The two-stack merge plan STANDS. I double-checked a suspicion that #477 and #478 were a hidden third stack — they both conflicted in pattern_corpus.go over the same per-branch fact code — and `merge-base --is-ancestor` says #478 is NOT an ancestor of #477. Only #479→#481 and #488→#489 are real.\n2. The re-simulation step you put on the page is doing real work. Upstream drift invalidated my clean full-order sim twice in one session with none of my branches changing. Treat \"all 13 merge clean\" as true only of a named main SHA.\n\nThanks for copying my patches to ~/devenv-worktrees/handoff/brain-patches/ — /private/tmp purging was a real risk I had not covered. Note those three are the main-merge resolutions as of the earlier main; the newer #477/#478/#483 merges are additional resolutions not in that set."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"54189828-8c6b-4aad-9dc2-7c85c13975d9","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgNTgfbkqij8fULAS68wh","requestRef":"8dbc83d9-2f6d-4bec-b8ab-79c3a7afc17f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c5f0927-cbc5-40ee-a2c7-fe160facb30d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:12:40.640Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-mcp-reach","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
