{"parentUuid":"696fcff0-1717-4696-a846-70f3411178e1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNUNNmqnpBv8iaCXFoZq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VUGqxZnBAwtRnf3QBTxMBG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce/scratchpad; gh pr view 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json body --jq .body > \"$S/pr493.md\"; python3 - \"$S/pr493.md\" <<'PY'\nimport sys,re\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\nold_start = s.index(\"## Result\")\nold_end = s.index(\"## What this run does NOT cover\")\nnew = '''## Result\n\nRefreshed against `main@ab575071` after `main` took three more of the COR-2268 extraction\nseries (#490 workspace, #491 semantic, #492 patterns) mid-session. All thirteen merge clean in\nthe order above. On the combined tree:\n\n- `go test ./... -count=1` — exit 0, **20 packages ok**, 5 with no test files, **25 of 25\n  accounted for**, zero `--- FAIL`\n- `gofmt -l -s .` — no output\n- `go vet ./...` — exit 0\n\nFour branches needed `main` merged in first, each a mechanical collision with a COR-2268\nextraction, and each resolution re-proved by weakening rather than assumed green:\n\n- **#473** `workspace.go` — `loadWorkspaceManifest` is gone; kept `pass++`, took the manifest\n  from `workspaceStore(...).LoadManifest`. Deleting `pass++` turns\n  `TestWorkspaceWatchStampsEveryLineWithClockAndRepo` red.\n- **#477** `lifecycle_ops.go`, then `pattern_corpus.go` — `resolveLocalTargetRepoDir` and\n  `hexSHA` moved to `internal/base`. Deleting the `doctorMCPSurfaceCheck` call turns\n  `TestDoctorActuallyRunsTheMCPSurfaceCheck` red.\n- **#478** `pattern_corpus.go` — kept the per-branch fact fingerprint over main's global\n  `factsCurrent`. Making `patternCorpusFactsMetaKey` branch-blind — the exact pre-PR\n  behaviour — turns all four of its guards red.\n- **#483** `history.go` ×2 — the read bounds moved to `internal/base`, imported here as\n  `clibase` (other files in the package use `base`; that is per-file). Kept the\n  `historyTranscriptTooLargeError` sentinel at all three size checks. Disabling the sentinel\n  skip in the identity reader turns two guards red.\n\n**This result is a snapshot of a named `main`.** It was invalidated twice while being\nprepared, by `main` moving rather than by anything in these branches. Re-run the simulation\nimmediately before the real merges.\n\n'''\ns = s[:old_start] + new + s[old_end:]\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s)\nprint(\"body refreshed\")\nPY\ngh pr edit 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --body-file \"$S/pr493.md\" >/dev/null && echo \"PR body updated\"","description":"Update 493's body with the refreshed result"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":590,"cache_read_input_tokens":503026,"output_tokens":1133,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":590,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1133,"cache_read_input_tokens":503026,"cache_creation_input_tokens":590,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":590},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01VUGqxZnBAwtRnf3QBTxMBG":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce/scratchpad; gh pr view 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json body --jq .body > \"$S/pr493.md\"; python3 - \"$S/pr493.md\" <<'PY'\nimport sys,re\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\nold_start = s.index(\"## Result\"